### VALID EMAIL AND PASSWORD
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "supersecret"
}

### WRONG MAIL VALID PASSWORD
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testexample.com",
  "password": "supersecret"
}

### VALID EMAIL WRONG PASSWORD
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@examplee.com",
  "password": "test"
}

### DUPLICATE EMAIL
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "supersecret"
}

### DUPLICATE WITH DIFFERENT CASE + SPACES
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "  TEST@Example.com ",
  "password": "supersecret"
}

### VALID EMAIL AND PASSWORD (GET)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "supersecret"
}

### VALID EMAIL WRONG PASSWORD (GET)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "supersecret1"
}

### WRONG EMAIL VALID PASSWORD (GET)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test1@example.com",
  "password": "supersecret"
}


### LOGIN OK
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "supersecret"
}

### ME (logged in)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### ME (fake cookie, should be 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Cookie: connect.sid=fake